  "name": "Text icon parts MDI",
  "description": "Material Design icons in rich text icon parts. The watch has no MDI catalogue, so an icon part carries the drawing of every mdi: name it can draw in iconPaths, keyed by name and written in name order. A template that renders an mdi: name the part carries draws that drawing, here the water-alert icon of a flow template. A typed mdi: name draws its carried drawing. A typed mdi: name with no drawing is left out, as is a template name the part carries no drawing of. An icon change aimed at a part can swap in an mdi: name the part carries. An SF Symbol part draws its symbol with no path, whatever drawings it carries. A resolved Material Design part carries its name as symbol and its drawing as path.",
